{"ts":1775921535963,"event":"assistant_text_stream","runId":"5b9ee44d-c02b-4833-ac56-91c1ba455133","evtType":"text_end","delta":"","content":"[[reply_to_current]]Chicago’s having a bright but chilly spring day: about 44 °F (7 °C) right now with sun and a few high clouds, an easy ESE breeze near 8 mph, and a “feels like” closer to 40 °F. Expect highs to peak around the upper 40s to near 50 °F this afternoon before low clouds and some evening fog drift back in. Tomorrow turns much warmer, windy, and wetter with rain moving in during the afternoon and night."}
{"ts":1775921536035,"event":"assistant_message_end","runId":"5b9ee44d-c02b-4833-ac56-91c1ba455133","rawText":"[[reply_to_current]]Chicago’s having a bright but chilly spring day: about 44 °F (7 °C) right now with sun and a few high clouds, an easy ESE breeze near 8 mph, and a “feels like” closer to 40 °F. Expect highs to peak around the upper 40s to near 50 °F this afternoon before low clouds and some evening fog drift back in. Tomorrow turns much warmer, windy, and wetter with rain moving in during the afternoon and night.","rawThinking":""}
